        <item>
            <title>1.7.0</title>
            <pubDate>Sat, 26 Sep 2026 00:11:30 -0700</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>121</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.7.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Darkbloom Control v1.7.0

- Organize Models into collapsible Enabled and Available groups, with narrower
  cards and up to two columns. Models that still need downloading are visually muted.
- Add an independent daily-runtime slider to each model card. Forecasts are
  what-if estimates based on observed activity and configured electricity cost;
  they do not schedule or change provider runtime. Earnings inputs are account-level
  and assume this Mac produced the recorded work for that model.
- Show whole-Mac GPU utilization as a menu-bar ring, with temperature coloring
  when fresh readings are available. Missing or stale utilization omits the ring;
  missing temperature uses a neutral color.
- Share GPU sampling between the menu bar and dashboard to avoid duplicate polling.

Coming soon: the iOS companion and remote pairing/control. Fan controls, richer
statistics, and automatic model warming also remain planned and are not enabled
in this release.
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/knightfolk/DarkbloomControl/releases/download/v1.7.0/Darkbloom-Control-1.7.0-mac-arm64.zip" length="6225664" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="54GDTm1tVrr50mdXVKCGyt8bFN3MV+1qvxn8ejfvKQSXosUahUhblukCzWKyK9PEo9aFo+VhUqlMnJQaEK9TCQ=="/>
        </item>
        <item>
            <title>1.6.0</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 24 Sep 2026 22:19:53 -0700</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>120</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.6.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Darkbloom Control v1.6.0

- Add Chat inside the dashboard and in a separate resizable window. Both views
  share one in-memory conversation; prompts and replies are discarded on quit.
- Make the destination explicit for each new conversation. Local hosting is the
  default. If the local endpoint is unavailable, sending stays disabled until
  you choose another destination; chat never switches to the paid network on
  its own.
- Add an opt-in Darkbloom network route with a clear paid-inference warning,
  consumer balance and pricing information, and a fresh balance check before
  each send. The network can still reject a request when credits are
  insufficient. The consumer API key is stored in the macOS Keychain.
- Add local hosting controls for loopback or LAN access, model selection, and
  optional endpoint bearer authentication. Chat also supports a local endpoint
  intentionally configured without a bearer token.
- Keep beta review builds separate from the installed app's preferences,
  history, and single-instance lock so they can run side by side.
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/knightfolk/DarkbloomControl/releases/download/v1.6.0/Darkbloom-Control-1.6.0-mac-arm64.zip" length="6187574" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="mQcmhGMHFD3Mlcu1QwmxuJRhiJ7t78r074vPdGBlJW0L81FI2Srq4rJQKgrwhzOED4lcRNnNS0sv5cdV1MURAA=="/>
        </item>
        <item>
            <title>1.5.0</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 24 Sep 2026 12:00:14 -0700</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>118</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.5.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Darkbloom Control v1.5.0

- Show best-effort, whole-Mac GPU utilization in the provider resources panel,
  alongside the provider's reported GPU memory.
- Show provider request activity: `1+` while inference is active and the exact
  accepted requests remaining during a graceful drain.
- Use the CLI's native graceful-stop behavior to pause new admissions and drain
  accepted work, replacing the app's former idle-polling stop flow.
- Keep the Models window within the visible screen area with a compact toolbar
  and responsive, enabled-first model cards.
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/knightfolk/DarkbloomControl/releases/download/v1.5.0/Darkbloom-Control-1.5.0-mac-arm64.zip" length="6041541" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="TFXSI2zi0TMv9L03pUsB+HwfHt/RUXYWlGjSmJnTr9Ny/0A7+t3sbttld4GaRe68zmq28DgEbNDX1u4dSK+0CA=="/>
        </item>
        <item>
            <title>1.4.2</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 23 Sep 2026 20:53:25 -0700</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>117</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.4.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Darkbloom Control v1.4.2

- Give the Models dashboard a larger, screen-aware window so the card grid is
  easier to read at normal size.
- Show up to three model cards across and two rows at once, with additional
  models available by scrolling.
- Reduce space above the cards with a collapsed selection summary and compact
  search field beside the section picker.
- Sort enabled models first while preserving the existing order within each
  enabled or disabled group.
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/knightfolk/DarkbloomControl/releases/download/v1.4.2/Darkbloom-Control-1.4.2-mac-arm64.zip" length="5848947" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="quAv/y84csZYkJZe9BMCXf9QGaAWbBseuLhiz5NlL2WAYmMuGToS2H8KcncM7WFwhr925gpl5OlnYuOOBZWPCw=="/>
