        <item>
            <title>1.4.1</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 23 Sep 2026 19:45:48 -0700</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>116</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.4.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Darkbloom Control v1.4.1

- Refine model cards with larger, centered metric icons and overlapping values.
- Explain card metrics, network demand, request counts, opportunity grades, and
  staged enable/preload controls on hover.
- Add active and waiting network request counts next to demand and replace the
  demand bars with a shaded, color-coded shield.
- Put enable and load-at-startup switches on each downloaded model card, remove
  the redundant catalog RAM requirement from the card face, and keep forecasts
  and detailed compatibility information in Manage & Forecast.
- Keep card sizing uniform and readable, with at most four columns.
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/knightfolk/DarkbloomControl/releases/download/v1.4.1/Darkbloom-Control-1.4.1-mac-arm64.zip" length="5838318" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="7UnLhHVI6eXzydgAbkO4JHvsJs+XM68/ruAc9qxLHshrExokp40VTzE8DTsGKNpd1JDz9ePgkM1F072YlkBrBg=="/>
